{"id": "sf-plumbing-permit-after-state-license-revocation", "title": "Four San Francisco trade permits listed licences after state revocation", "seconds": 94.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.035, "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "dda5f8ae7dc32122", "words": 273, "beats": [{"scene": "dates", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California’s contractor register lists a plumbing license revoked on May 2, 2024.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.33, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "was", "the", "license", "status", "when", "the", "permit", "was", "issued?"], "sub": "San Francisco trade permits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 1.24, 1.7, 1.99, 2.1, 2.46, 2.85, 3.27, 3.43, 3.66, 4.19, 4.53]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 5.45, "t1": 6.73, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A lead, not a finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.31, 0.39, 0.64, 0.8, 0.88]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The signed order barred applications for reissuance or reinstatement for five years.", "t0": 6.85, "t1": 11.26, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "California Contractors State License Board", "text": "Signed revocation order", "mark": "Signed revocation order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.53, 0.87, 1.17, 1.81, 2.0, 2.56, 2.7, 3.32, 3.48, 3.76]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "50 days later, the City recorded an application with the same license number and holder.", "t0": 11.38, "t1": 16.37, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "The same license number and holder", "heading": "State register and City application", "source": "register", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "State revocation", "value": "May 2, 2024"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "City application", "value": "June 21, 2024"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.63, 1.28, 1.45, 1.73, 2.19, 2.32, 2.97, 3.13, 3.24, 3.51, 3.89, 4.18, 4.33]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City issued the permit June 25 and marked it complete on December 12.", "t0": 16.49, "t1": 21.34, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "permit", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "June 2024 permit", "mark": "June 2024 permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.87, 0.99, 1.42, 1.69, 2.49, 2.78, 3.05, 3.15, 3.61, 3.77, 4.19]}, {"scene": "dates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The July 11 rough inspection and the December 12 final mechanical inspection were both approved.", "t0": 21.46, "t1": 26.77, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "job", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "City inspection report", "mark": "City inspection report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.45, 0.82, 1.02, 1.92, 2.15, 2.25, 2.66, 3.0, 3.3, 3.79, 4.34, 4.52, 4.75]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In 2012, the City issued a mechanical permit 21 days after the listed license was revoked.", "t0": 26.99, "t1": 32.2, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "2012 mechanical permit", "heading": "Three weeks between records", "source": "tregister", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "License revoked", "value": "October 11"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Permit issued", "value": "November 1"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 1.06, 1.21, 1.49, 1.76, 1.82, 2.31, 2.66, 3.13, 3.41, 3.68, 3.79, 4.13, 4.52, 4.7]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The rough furnace inspection passed. The permit later expired without a recorded final inspection.", "t0": 32.32, "t1": 37.3, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "tjob", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Mechanical inspection record", "mark": "Mechanical inspection record"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.35, 0.69, 1.18, 2.04, 2.22, 2.56, 2.79, 3.26, 3.53, 3.61, 4.08, 4.42]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "An October 2019 revocation also barred reinstatement applications for five years.", "t0": 37.42, "t1": 42.62, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "chanorder", "kicker": "California Contractors State License Board", "text": "2019 electrical license order", "mark": "2019 electrical license order"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.59, 0.86, 1.25, 2.28, 2.7, 3.06, 3.66, 4.32, 4.49, 4.78]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "32 days later, the City issued two electrical permits listing that license at the same site.", "t0": 42.74, "t1": 47.88, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two electrical permits for the same site", "heading": "The scope matched on both forms", "source": "chanjob1", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "First permit", "value": "Rewiring"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Second permit", "value": "Rewiring"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.63, 1.38, 1.55, 1.82, 2.12, 2.36, 2.81, 3.25, 3.61, 3.82, 4.26, 4.39, 4.5, 4.78]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "They described the same rewiring, carried different rough inspection codes, and were completed the same day.", "t0": 48.0, "t1": 53.03, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "chanjob2", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Building Inspection", "text": "Second electrical permit", "mark": "Second electrical permit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 0.73, 1.05, 2.0, 2.36, 2.65, 2.85, 3.33, 3.69, 3.86, 4.01, 4.41, 4.52, 4.78]}, {"scene": "archive", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]", "suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Both sites had owner-builder filings. Those separate building permits do not establish a trade permit exemption.", "t0": 53.15, "t1": 59.15, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Owner-builder permits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.7, 0.92, 1.59, 2.67, 3.0, 3.34, 3.64, 4.03, 4.17, 4.35, 4.88, 4.97, 5.22, 5.49]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In all three years, state law required a signed declaration of licensure or the basis for an exemption.", "t0": 59.37, "t1": 65.12, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "law", "kicker": "California Contractors State License Board", "text": "Licensing declaration", "mark": "Licensing declaration"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.31, 0.54, 1.18, 1.5, 1.72, 2.11, 2.2, 2.53, 3.07, 3.19, 4.31, 4.48, 4.6, 5.01, 5.13, 5.22]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The public permit entry does not show what the applicant declared.", "t0": 65.24, "t1": 68.32, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The signed declaration"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.82, 1.11, 1.3, 1.53, 1.85, 2.01, 2.13, 2.56]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A separate roofing license had been reinstated by the time the City issued a June 2016 building permit.", "t0": 68.44, "t1": 74.0, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "A separate roofing license", "heading": "Reinstated before the building permit", "source": "roofpermit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "License reinstated", "value": "August 2015"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Building permit", "value": "June 2016"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.54, 0.86, 1.23, 1.36, 1.54, 2.14, 2.27, 2.37, 2.61, 2.73, 3.01, 3.32, 3.41, 3.69, 3.98, 4.52, 4.87]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "77 permits fell between reinstatement and recorded expiration. Nine later permits need a separate renewal record.", "t0": 74.12, "t1": 80.98, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "86 permits matched the old roofing revocation", "heading": "License history at each permit date", "source": "roofdecision", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Before expiration", "value": "77 permits"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Renewal unresolved", "value": "9 permits"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.76, 1.18, 1.46, 1.83, 2.52, 2.71, 3.16, 4.59, 4.89, 5.13, 5.49, 5.7, 5.79, 6.13, 6.51]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The license history, signed declaration and job card could show who was authorized and who did the work.", "t0": 81.1, "t1": 86.57, "shot": "r16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["License history", "Signed declaration", "Job card"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.54, 1.21, 1.57, 2.16, 2.27, 2.54, 2.84, 3.03, 3.27, 3.42, 3.58, 4.33, 4.61, 4.79, 4.97, 5.08]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The matching records do not establish that unlicensed work occurred or that public money was lost.", "t0": 86.69, "t1": 91.86, "shot": "r17", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "What the records establish"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.84, 0.97, 1.14, 1.63, 1.82, 2.41, 2.69, 3.47, 3.67, 3.86, 4.21, 4.45, 4.63]}, {"scene": "declaration", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 91.98, "t1": 93.87, "shot": "r18", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.47, 0.56, 0.98, 1.15, 1.25]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"dates": "Match the license number and dates", "archive": "Earlier permits and inspection records", "declaration": "What did the applicant declare?"}, "look": "map", "hook": "question"}